+prefill and decode requests. It listens on ``Process.proxy_port`` and forwards other
+routes, including ``/metrics``, to the worker's HTTP port.
+
+Upstream: llm-d-router ``cmd/pd-sidecar`` and ``pkg/sidecar/proxy``
